[00:11.24]I moved the glass to my lips, took a sip and sighed
[00:11.24]我将玻璃杯送到唇边 呷了一口 轻声叹息
[00:14.05]Why does it feel like our life's on a Slip 'N Slide?
[00:14.05]为何生活就像滑梯一般 让人身不由己
[00:16.61]Kids, they add stress, work ain't working the best
[00:16.61]孩子带来压力 工作也总不尽如人意
[00:18.87]But that ain't the explanation why this love is a mess
[00:18.87]但这都不是这段感情陷入僵局的原因
[00:21.33]I guess priorities are prioritised over time
[00:21.33]我猜 随着时间推移 我们的重心慢慢转移
[00:24.56]And the only moments we spend are sleeping side by side
[00:24.56]睡在两边的时刻 才是彼此的交集
[00:27.42]Morning breaks, same old nags and complaints
[00:27.42]清晨破晓 又是无休止的唠叨和抱怨
[00:29.50]I'm just trying to drink my coffee, if we engage, then we'll be late
[00:29.50]我只想安静喝杯咖啡 争吵只会让我们迟到
[00:32.62]I push it down to avoid a situation
[00:32.62]我把所有情绪都压抑在心底
[00:35.30]But all it does is come out in the public places
[00:35.30]但它却总在公共场合爆发
[00:37.95]Can't be as open when they recognise our faces
[00:37.95]当人们认出我们时 我们无法再肆无忌惮
[00:40.51]If they think it's heated I guess that's an understatement
[00:40.51]如果他们觉得我们很生气 我想那都太轻描淡写
[00:42.82]But it used to be alive, be electric, burning bright
[00:42.82]但曾经的我们热情似火 光芒万丈
[00:45.41]There's a spark left in the embers, find some gasoline tonight
[00:45.41]余烬中还有一丝火星 今夜就让它燃成火焰
[00:48.09]Shut the world down, put the past behind
[00:48.09]隔绝世界 忘掉过去
[00:50.41]See the mountain, got so far to climb
[00:50.41]看那高山 还有那么远的路要攀登
[00:52.03]Is all that's left for you and I
[00:52.03]所有剩下的是否就只剩你和我的
[00:53.39]Regrets
[00:53.39]悔恨
[00:54.73]I'm not saying it's all in my head
[00:54.73]我不是说这都是我的臆想
[00:57.39]But I can't help thinking, "What's next?"
[00:57.39]但我还是忍不住思索 “接下来呢”
[01:00.04]When tomorrow is all we got left
[01:00.04]当明天就是我们仅剩的所有
[01:02.68]Confessing regrets
[01:02.68]坦白悔恨
[01:05.37]Why's there distance when we're right here?
[01:05.37]明明近在咫尺 为何心有距离
