[01:10.89]在爱里开战 谁都无法全身而退
[01:13.35]Confessing regrets
[01:13.35]坦白悔恨
[01:14.74]You're too young to understand that daddy's coming home
[01:14.74]你还太小 不懂爸爸总是会回家
[01:17.26]Every time I leave the house, you think I'm forever gone
[01:17.26]每次我出门 你都以为我会永远离开
[01:19.96]Guess it's from the hundred calls, goodnights on the telephone
[01:19.96]也许是因为那上百通电话 那些在电话里说的晚安
[01:22.55]See this tour, I got to get it done, but why though?
[01:22.55]这次巡演我必须完成 但为何
[01:25.10]Always said I'd pause work as soon as you came
[01:25.10]我总是说你出生后我就会停下工作
[01:27.47]Without structure, I just slipped into depression again
[01:27.47]可没有了约束 我又一次陷入了抑郁
[01:30.10]This is just one of the things that I could never explain
[01:30.10]这是我永远无法解释的事情之一
[01:32.72]Each and every day rolling the dice, forever caught in the game
[01:32.72]每天都在赌博 永远被困在这场游戏中
[01:35.97]Still uprooting you both until the sickness started
