[01:38.79]Missed appointments, ripped apart
[01:38.79]错过的约会 彼此的心都已四分五裂
[01:40.78]Aimed to be the best dad here, but missed the mark
[01:40.78]原本想成为最好的父亲 却错得一塌糊涂
[01:43.45]Breaking both you and your sister's heart, and your mother's too
[01:43.45]我伤了你和你妹妹的心 还有你妈妈的心
[01:46.62]I see the wood for the trees 'cause there's no other truth
[01:46.62]我看到了森林的全貌 因为这是不争的事实
[01:49.32]I gotta stop putting work so far in front of you
[01:49.32]我必须停止把工作放在你们前面
[01:51.95]'Cause there is so much more love that a man can lose
[01:51.95]因为一个男人能失去的爱实在太多了
[01:54.82]Trying to get back what I've lost, sitting here, and all I've got is
[01:54.82]我试图找回我失去的一切 坐在这里 我拥有的只有
